[00:00.48]Heaven
[00:00.48] 天堂
[00:03.49]Whenever I'm near you I'm in heaven
[00:03.49] 每当靠近你 我如临天堂
[00:09.16]The world could separate us if we let it
[00:09.16] 也许世界 将你我分隔
[00:14.55]But we're better than we've ever been
[00:14.55] 但你我的情愫 能比以往 更为牢固
[00:18.13]Never
[00:18.13] 从未
[00:21.05]Doubted we could sail through stormy weather
[00:21.05] 怀疑我们能航行 驶过暴风骤雨
[00:26.83]We went through the furnace, burned together
[00:26.83] 我们共度磨练 历经焚烧
[00:32.29]And clay turned into porcelain
[00:32.29] 陶土终成瓷器
[00:35.44]Suddenly everything's frozen
[00:35.44] 那刹风华间 一切停格
[00:41.29]Caught in the spell of this moment
[00:41.29] 沉浸于此时此刻的魔幻中
[00:46.53]Just
[00:46.53] 就请
[00:47.87]Hold me in your arms
[00:47.87] 把我拥入怀中
