[00:53.63]As the sun closes on
[00:53.63] 夕阳西下
[00:56.97]A beautiful day
[00:56.97] 美好时光
[00:59.56]I can see you now
[00:59.56] 此刻我满眼是你
[01:02.31]Though so much has changed
[01:02.31] 尽管时过境迁
