[01:05.30] 我正再度
[01:08.71]All over again
[01:08.71] 坠入爱河
[01:13.16]Silence
[01:13.16] 沉默
[01:16.20]There is so much said inside this silence
[01:16.20] 沉默之间 有太多言语 难以道尽
[01:21.94]Some things just can't be explained by science
[01:21.94] 有些事情 科学也无从解释
[01:27.52]The energy I feel for you
[01:27.52] 我感受到你的能量
[01:30.76]Higher
